 *   DREAM_WIKI_HOME          obsidian vault root  (default ~/obsidian/dream-memory; +/memory)
 *   CODEX_MEMORY_DIR         codex store root     (default ~/.codex/memories)
 *   DREAM_RECONCILE_THRESHOLD  cosine cut-off     (default 0.83)
 *   DREAM_RECONCILE_MODEL    judge model override 'provider/id' (default sonnet-class)
